I haven't added the enrichment fetch. The node's `with` clause is its entire authority, and it currently grants only `aap:caps/kb-read@0.1.0`. Adding `http-client` without changing that grant would give the node authority its declaration doesn't show. Once the graph's `with` clause is updated to include `aap:caps/http-client@0.1.0`, the fetch can be added. Building the URL from the raw question also sends untrusted user text to an external host, so that call should URL-encode the input and stay within the host allowlist.

